{
  "name": "dsh-cmd-pad",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "DSH Web UI 插件：测试命令行速查面板——命令按自定义分组+项目归档、一键复制；「上次使用」动态最近使用视图（范围切换）。软依赖 better-sidebar（peer optional）：装了走侧边栏 Tab 主形态（order 45，支持一键运行——新开专用终端直送执行、危险命令双人工确认），没装走浮动图标+非模态抽屉降级形态（无运行只复制）",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./src/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.js",
    "./client": "./src/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "cordis": "^4.0.0-rc.8",
    "dsh-better-sidebar": ">=0.12.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "dsh-better-sidebar": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
